<title>UK: Molins first half pretax up to 13.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Molins first half pretax up to 13.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	     29.9		    vs 25.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.5		    vs  5.9</p>
<p> Pretax		    13.6		    vs 11.3</p>
<p> Turnover		 147.2		    vs 123.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Specialist engineering group Molins said that the comparative figures for 1995 had been restated to reflect changes in its pensions accounting.</p>
</text>
